  (text "POWER INPUT & PROTECTION
F1 is the ONLY element between J1(+) and the rest of the board.
D1 (reverse crowbar) sits electrically immediately behind F1.
Silkscreen: large filled + (J1.1) and - (J1.2); variant text field: 26V MAX (24V BOM) / 58V MAX (56V BOM)."
    (at 38.1 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)))
    (uuid "8e7da86f-652d-47dd-88ed-f3d90c838b02")
  )
  (text "Bulk bank C4-C11 returns ONLY through Q1/R1 (BULK_RTN).
Precharge via R1 100R: tau ~0.35s. Q1 enhances from +12V rail
through R2; D3 clamps VGS at 10V. One PCB, two BOMs:
values shown 24V-BOM | 56V-BOM on the same footprint."
